#: who-iris/glossary/who-iris.glossary.json:12
#. Glossary term alternative label: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/who-iris/ns#glossary/who-terms/quality-of-the-evidence
msgid "certainty of the evidence"
msgstr "certeza de la evidencia"

#: who-iris/glossary/who-iris.glossary.json:12
#. Glossary term alternative label: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/who-iris/ns#glossary/who-terms/quality-of-the-evidence
msgid "confidence in the estimates of effect"
msgstr "confianza en las estimaciones del efecto"

#: who-iris/glossary/who-iris.glossary.json:12
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/who-iris/ns#glossary/who-terms/quality-of-the-evidence
msgid "In the context of guideline development, the confidence that the estimates of an effect are adequate to support a particular decision or recommendation. Rated high, moderate, low or very low."
msgstr "En el contexto de la elaboración de directrices, la confianza en que las estimaciones de un efecto son adecuadas para respaldar una decisión o recomendación concreta. Se califica como alta, moderada, baja o muy baja."

#: who-iris/glossary/who-iris.glossary.json:12
#. Glossary term label: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/who-iris/ns#glossary/who-terms/quality-of-the-evidence
msgid "quality of the evidence"
msgstr "calidad de la evidencia"
